{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1942","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Farmer John's Favorite Function"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"5 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"href":"https://soundcloud.com/user-838515264/camellia-parts-ooparts"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ΩΩPARTS - Camellia"}],"kind":"link"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"⠀"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Farmer John has an array $$$a$$$ of length $$$n$$$. He also has a function $$$f$$$ with the following recurrence: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(1) = \\sqrt{a_1}$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" For all $$$i \\gt 1$$$, $$$f(i) = \\sqrt{f(i-1)+a_i}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that $$$f(i)$$$ is not necessarily an integer."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"He plans to do $$$q$$$ updates to the array. Each update, he gives you two integers $$$k$$$ and $$$x$$$ and he wants you to set $$$a_k = x$$$. After each update, he wants to know $$$\\lfloor f(n) \\rfloor$$$, where $$$\\lfloor t \\rfloor$$$ denotes the value of $$$t$$$ rounded down to the nearest integer."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains $$$n$$$ and $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\leq n, q \\leq 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$), the length of $$$a$$$ and the number of updates he will perform."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n$$$ ($$$0 \\leq a_i \\leq 10^{18}$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next $$$q$$$ lines each contain two integers $$$k$$$ and $$$x$$$ ($$$1 \\leq k \\leq n$$$, $$$0 \\leq x \\leq 10^{18}$$$), the index of the update and the element he will replace $$$a_k$$$ with."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each update, output an integer, $$$\\lfloor f(n) \\rfloor$$$, on a new line."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5 6\n0 14 0 7 6\n1 4\n1 3\n2 15\n4 1\n5 2\n5 8\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n2\n3\n2\n1\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n15 10\n3364 1623 5435 7 6232 245 7903 3880 9738 577 4598 1868 1112 8066 199\n14 4284\n14 8066\n6 92\n6 245\n2 925\n2 1623\n5 176\n5 6232\n3 1157\n3 5435\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"