e first update is $$$[4, 14, 0, 7, 6]$$$. The values of $$$f$$$ are:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(1)=2$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(2)=4$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(3)=2$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(4)=3$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(5)=3$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Since $$$\\lfloor f(5) \\rfloor = 3$$$, we output $$$3$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The array after the second update is $$$[3, 14, 0, 7, 6]$$$. The values of $$$f$$$, rounded to $$$6$$$ decimal places, are:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(1)\\approx 1.732051$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(2)\\approx 3.966365$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(3)\\approx 1.991573$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(4)\\approx 2.998595$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(5)\\approx 2.999766$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Since $$$\\lfloor f(5) \\rfloor = 2$$$, we output $$$2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"1942F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1942/problem/F"}